
@startuml 02_NationalFlagOptionService

title 2. NationalFlagOptionService - 선택 가능한 아바타(국기 아이콘) 목록

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class NationalFlagOption {
  - NationalFlagCode: string
  - NationalFlagImageUrl: string
  - DisplayOrder: int
}

interface NationalFlagOptionRepository {
  + FindAllNationalFlagOptions(): Task<List<NationalFlagOption>>
  + FindNationalFlagOptionByCode(NationalFlagCode: string): Task<NationalFlagOption>
}

interface NationalFlagOptionService {
  + ListAvailableNationalFlags(): Result<List<NationalFlagOption>, ServiceError>
}

class ServiceError <<see 00_CommonTypes>>

NationalFlagOptionService ..> NationalFlagOptionRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
NationalFlagOptionService ..> NationalFlagOption
NationalFlagOptionRepository ..> NationalFlagOption
NationalFlagOptionService ..> ServiceError : 실패 시 반환

note right of NationalFlagOptionService
  단순 조회 위주. "선택한 코드가 실제로 존재하는 아바타인지"
  검증은 PlayerService.ChangeNationalFlag 쪽에서 처리함.
end note

@enduml
